   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "EVD - Phe240, Asp220 and Glu118 in 7CCU show density for multiple conformations",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Each had a single conformation in the deposited model. Density contoured at 0.5σ supports the alternate conformations qFit placed."
   },
