   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - phenix.refine re-refinement and final refinement",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Five macro cycles with NQH flips, isotropic individual ADPs, riding hydrogens, ordered solvent updated every macro cycle, and optimized xyz and ADP weights. The same settings are used for the re-refined and the post-qFit models."
   },
